yJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Ti_HP5D0V_7z9_q43ayn7Q","review_id":"C2a7N-SQ8hEEU-BFCv5nDw","date":"2016-01-18T00:35:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9482525587081909,"text_excerpt":"This place is always a go-to spot for me. Just about everything is delicious and I haven't had a bad experience yet regarding the food, the service, or the restaurant itself. My top favorites are the chicken Alfredo pizza and the spinach dip is one of the best I've tried (and I've had my fair share of spinach dips). It's a small, quaint location and usually doesn't have a wait time to sit down and eat. Service is always friendly. I don't mind coming in to eat or ordering to go because they're pretty quick for carry out orders too. It's definitely a small hidden jewel, I would miss it if I ever left."},{"business_id":"Ti_HP5D0V_7z9_q43ayn7Q","review_id":"0sya2cSfY2M-0XUSKalTAg","date":"2018-02-28T15:29:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9309157133102417,"text_excerpt":"I like this place! I've had the pizza a few times and it is always good and filling. Really loaded down slices with lots of toppings. Their caesar salad dressing is also very good. Sometimes we get extra to bring home! Also the service here is so nice and friendly. I will be back."},{"business_id":"Ti_HP5D0V_7z9_q43ayn7Q","review_id":"_UvGgXHoRWrKAzn-8PlMCA","date":"2011-12-27T01:07:53","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9299360513687134,"text_excerpt":"The pizza at Olive Branch Cafe is consistently amazing. We order from them weekly and I have never been disappointed. Their lasagna and caesar salads are amazing too. They have a crab and corn bisque that is also fantastic. The pizzas are amazing as well, it's the best in algiers (Moe's is the best one the west bank though!) Sign up for their email list and you will get regular coupons and discounts. I got $5 off a $20 order for my birthday and a 2 for 1 entree for our anniversary. Not open on Sundays, my only complaint!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Ti_HP5D0V_7z9_q43ayn7Q","photo_id":"xnIw3QJ3cJpLvqN4pq3ZWg","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/xnIw3QJ3cJpLvqN4pq3ZWg.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
